  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br>Pet friendly for small to medium dogs!<br><br>Situated in Seacreest beach between Rosemary and Alys Beach, enjoy all the shops, entertainment, resort pool and private beach access our house offers.<br><br>Walk or bike to everything and enjoy the tram service to take you to the beach. Our beach and resort pool amenities are separate from Rosemary beach.<br><br>BEACH CHAIRS AND UMBRELLAS: We start the season with 6 Tommy Bahama beach chairs and 2 beach umbrellas...there's also a cooler bag. Unfortunately, I can't guarantee this since some get damaged, some \"walk away\" and sometimes we end up with more!<br><br>With room for 14, there's plenty of room for large families or groups to spread out and enjoy.<br>The space<br>Sleeping accomodations<br>2nd Floor:<br>~King Ensuite with 2 built in twin bunks<br>~King Ensuite<br>3rd Floor:<br>~King Ensuite<br>~4 twin bunk room<br>~2 hall twin bunks<br><br>Close to everything:<br>~.2 mile walk to the luxury resort pool and poolside grill and bar<br>~.5 mile walk to the deeded beach entrance (or take the tram!)<br>~.2 mile walk to restaurants and shops of Seacrest<br>~.5 mile (12 minute) walk to Rosemary shops and restaurants<br><br>Fully stocked kitchen with Keurig, blender, crockpot and pots, pans and utensils.<br><br>Propane grill and grill utensils<br><br>Plenty of parking in front of and behind the house<br><br>Pets allowed (one small to medium dog...$100 fee charged through AirBnB/Vrbo)",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Luxury 4BR ~ 3 King Suites ~ Resort Pool & Beach"
        }
      ],
